{"v":4,"catch":"解密《GUMP》的秘密！","desc":"《VS.SUPER XEVIOUS MYSTERY OF GUMP》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1986 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n控制尖端戰鬥機 SOLVALOU，對抗 XEVIOUS 勢力以拯救人類。\n解決每個區域的秘密謎題，前往敵人的堡壘，他們的領袖阿甘正在那裡等待！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-04-11","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de901168660ad2a55a18fa1a4da03176685867d072132ff65238dffa0c4a8210.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/affde3ee9d36bd3b54c58bfc405fb94c1d946e593789ee745b0153ea3a2cf3a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf2b021ae0b3e564375d3d28bcd39b87e1d9092f2b1a505a87642d71c769cc05.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cdc27370eab8dd6455b3f9497be2ff8aef66f49d76205db0e6c529e455001de9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f073fb1970b64389259af24d0a2a06f02592d1d6cca62fad2f0b76717efbd984.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b804dd51b5512487e3ee3d7aaf539d1eecd21ff5050c3330280144d2b0f0003.jpg"],"titleId":"01004b30178d4000","dlc":[]}